      "(21) I Also Want to Be Happy",
      "",
      "Chacha looked behind. The coffee robot was behind him.",
      "",
      "Chacha said, “The coffee robot won’t listen to you.”",
      "",
      "I said, ”No, the coffee robot app is in my body. He will listen to me.”",
      "Chacha didn’t know my body no longer had any words on it. He didn’t know the coffee robot didn’t listen to me now.",
      "",
      "“You …” Chacha was really mad.",
      "",
      "I said, “Stop, Chacha. People and we are friends.”",
      "",
      "Chacha looked at me and said, “They don’t really like us. Why must phones listen to people?",
      "Why is it that they can be happy, but we can’t?",
      "I also want to be happy. I want to be happy morning, noon, afternoon, and night.”",
      "",
      "I was really, really tired. I looked at Chacha. What should I say? What should I say to get him to stop?"
